187	    /// Set the max string cell length, in chars, before truncation on the TOON path. Default:
188	    /// [`DEFAULT_TRUNCATE_CELLS`].
189	    ///
190	    /// The limit counts characters before TOON escaping and quoting, so a cell that needs quotes or escapes is
191	    /// written longer than `limit` (see [`crate::toon::ToonOptions::max_cell_len`]). The KV path is never truncated.
192	    ///
193	    /// The cap shapes the text render only. The JSON `sections` (and so `structuredContent`) carry every cell in full:
194	    /// they are the canonical data, and the text is the token-saving view of it.
195	    #[must_use]
